WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.831
Every number on INRGIFT carries a status and an exact timestamp.

2
00:00:04.831 --> 00:00:11.644
Live, delayed, end of day, closed, unavailable, stale and error each have their own badge and glyph.

3
00:00:11.644 --> 00:00:16.806
The page names the current data source and how the data flows.

4
00:00:16.806 --> 00:00:24.609
A dash means the source has no value; n/a means the metric does not apply. Nothing is filled with zeros.

5
00:00:24.609 --> 00:00:30.102
Research describes data. It carries no ratings, no price targets and no advice.
